	(descr "MYOUNG MY-2450-01 (CR2450-W) SMT CR2450 clip, nickel-plated C5191 phosphor bronze 0.25 mm (LCSC C964845), drawing MY-CP-0106 rev A/0. Height 5.70 above the PCB. Plate 25.5 x 23.2 with a 7.5 mm closed end and a stop flap; the cell slides in from the open end (+y). Pads 6.15 x 6.00, outer span 36.80, 9.20 from the closed end. Pad 1 = + (both legs), pad 2 = - : a bare 12 mm copper pad under the cell centre (no paste; order ENIG).")
